@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject invalid task input when adding, renaming, or tagging a task. A title must contain non-space
+text and be no more than 120 characters after trimming. Priorities must be `low`, `normal`, or
+`high`. Tags must not be empty or contain whitespace. Return a clear validation error explaining
+the rejected field, and leave the list unchanged on every rejected input.
+
+Acceptance criteria:
+
+- Adding and renaming reject empty or whitespace-only titles and titles over 120 characters.
+- Adding rejects priorities outside the supported three values.
+- Adding and tagging reject empty tags and tags containing spaces.
+- Invalid requests return a clear error and do not add, rename, tag, consume an identifier, or
+  refresh a task timestamp.
+- Automated tests cover each validation rule and state preservation.
